{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "把原式化为 $\\dfrac{\\ln x}{1/x}$，为 $\\dfrac{-\\infty}{+\\infty}$ 型，应用洛必达法则：\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{\\ln x}{1/x}=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{1/x}{-1/x^2}=\\lim_{x\\to0^+}(-x)=0.\n$$", "methods": ["洛必达法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{2xy-y^2-e^x-2x\\cos(x^2+y^2)}{2y\\cos(x^2+y^2)-2xy}$", "explanation": "对方程两边关于 $x$ 求导：\n$$\n\\cos(x^2+y^2)(2x+2yy')+e^x-y^2-2xyy'=0.\n$$\n整理含 $y'$ 的项，得\n$$\ny'\\bigl(2y\\cos(x^2+y^2)-2xy\\bigr)=y^2-e^x-2x\\cos(x^2+y^2),\n$$\n故\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{2xy-y^2-e^x-2x\\cos(x^2+y^2)}{2y\\cos(x^2+y^2)-2xy}.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["变上限积分", "单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$0<x\\le \\dfrac{1}{4}$", "explanation": "由变上限积分求导公式，\n$$\nF'(x)=2-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}.\n$$\n单调减少要求 $F'(x)\\le 0$，即\n$$\n2\\le \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\iff \\sqrt{x}\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\iff 0<x\\le \\frac{1}{4}.\n$$", "methods": ["变限积分求导", "求导公式"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{\\cos x}}+C$", "explanation": "原式化为\n$$\n\\int \\sin x\\,(\\cos x)^{-3/2}dx.\n$$\n令 $u=\\cos x$，则 $du=-\\sin x\\,dx$，\n$$\n\\int \\frac{\\tan x}{\\sqrt{\\cos x}}dx=-\\int u^{-3/2}du=2u^{-1/2}+C=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{\\cos x}}+C.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}(1+x^2)\\ln(1+x^2)-\\dfrac{1}{2}x^2-\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "由题意 $f'(x)=x\\ln(1+x^2)$。积分得\n$$\nf(x)=\\int x\\ln(1+x^2)dx.\n$$\n令 $u=1+x^2$，$du=2x\\,dx$，则\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\ln u\\,du=\\frac{1}{2}(u\\ln u-u)+C.\n$$\n代回得\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{2}(1+x^2)\\ln(1+x^2)-\\frac{1}{2}(1+x^2)+C.\n$$\n由 $f(0)=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$ 得 $C=0$，故\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{2}(1+x^2)\\ln(1+x^2)-\\frac{1}{2}x^2-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["无穷小", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "取数列 $x_k=\\dfrac{1}{k\\pi}$，则 $\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x_k}=0$，原式等于 $0$；再取 $x_k'=\\dfrac{2}{(4k+1)\\pi}$，则 $\\sin\\dfrac{1}{x_k'}=1$，原式为 $\\dfrac{1}{{x_k'}^2}\\to +\\infty$。因此它无界，但并不趋于无穷大，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["连续性", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "当 $x>1$ 时，$|x^2-1|=x^2-1$，故 $f(x)=x+1$；当 $x<1$ 时，$|x^2-1|=1-x^2$，故 $f(x)=-(x+1)$。于是\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to1^-}f(x)=-2,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to1^+}f(x)=2.\n$$\n左右极限不相等，因此在 $x=1$ 处不连续，选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "当 $0\\le x<1$ 时，\n$$\nF(x)=\\int_1^x t^2dt=-\\int_x^1 t^2dt=\\frac{x^3}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n当 $1\\le x\\le2$ 时，\n$$\nF(x)=\\int_1^x 1\\,dt=x-1.\n$$\n故选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["零点", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "求导得\n$$\nf'(x)=\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{e}.\n$$\n唯一驻点为 $x=e$，且在 $(0,e)$ 上递增，在 $(e,+\\infty)$ 上递减，因此 $x=e$ 是最大值点。又\n$$\nf(e)=1-1+k=k>0,\n$$\n且当 $x\\to0^+$ 或 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时，$f(x)\\to-\\infty$。故在 $(0,e)$ 和 $(e,+\\infty)$ 内各有一个零点，共 2 个，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["奇偶性", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "由 $f(-x)=-f(x)$ 知 $f$ 为奇函数。对等式求导得\n$$\nf'(-x)=f'(x),\n$$\n所以 $f'$ 为偶函数；再求导得\n$$\nf''(-x)=-f''(x),\n$$\n所以 $f''$ 为奇函数。若 $x<0$，则 $-x>0$，因此\n$$\nf'(x)=f'(-x)>0,\\qquad f''(x)=-f''(-x)<0.\n$$\n故选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数", "高阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y''=4x^2\\cos[f(x^2)]f''(x^2)-4x^2\\sin[f(x^2)]\\bigl(f'(x^2)\\bigr)^2+2\\cos[f(x^2)]f'(x^2)$", "explanation": "先求一阶导数：\n$$\ny'=\\cos[f(x^2)]\\cdot f'(x^2)\\cdot 2x.\n$$\n再对其求导，乘积法则与链式法则给出\n$$\ny''=2\\cos[f(x^2)]f'(x^2)+2x\\frac{d}{dx}\\Bigl(\\cos[f(x^2)]f'(x^2)\\Bigr).\n$$\n继续展开得\n$$\ny''=2\\cos[f(x^2)]f'(x^2)+4x^2\\cos[f(x^2)]f''(x^2)-4x^2\\sin[f(x^2)]\\bigl(f'(x^2)\\bigr)^2.\n$$", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-50$", "explanation": "将根式有理化：\n$$\nx(\\sqrt{x^2+100}+x)=\\frac{100x}{\\sqrt{x^2+100}-x}.\n$$\n因为 $x<0$，有 $\\sqrt{x^2+100}=|x|\\sqrt{1+100/x^2}=-x\\sqrt{1+100/x^2}$，于是\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^2+100}-x\\to -2x.\n$$\n更直接地，将分子分母同除以 $x$，得\n$$\n\\frac{100}{\\sqrt{1+100/x^2}-1}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}\n$$\n注意此处 $x<0$，等价写成\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^2+100}+x=\\frac{100}{\\sqrt{x^2+100}-x}\\sim\\frac{100}{-2x}=-\\frac{50}{x},\n$$\n所以原极限为 $-50$。", "methods": ["有理化"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "三角恒等变形"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\ln2$", "explanation": "利用恒等式 $1+\\cos 2x=2\\cos^2x$，原式化为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{\\pi/4}x\\sec^2x\\,dx.\n$$\n分部积分，取 $u=x,\\,dv=\\sec^2x\\,dx$，则 $du=dx,\\,v=\\tan x$，于是\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left[x\\tan x\\right]_0^{\\pi/4}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\tan x\\,dx.\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln(\\cos x)\\Big|_0^{\\pi/4}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln2,\n$$\n故原积分为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}\\ln2=\\frac{\\pi}{8}-\\frac{1}{4}\\ln2.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "令 $u=1+x$，则\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{x}{(1+x)^3}dx=\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{u-1}{u^3}du=\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{u^2}-\\frac{1}{u^3}\\right)du.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\left[-\\frac{1}{u}+\\frac{1}{2u^2}\\right]_1^{+\\infty}=0-\\left(-1+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=\\dfrac{1-\\sin x}{1-x^2}$", "explanation": "方程化为\n$$\ny'+\\frac{2x}{x^2-1}y=\\frac{\\cos x}{x^2-1}.\n$$\n积分因子为\n$$\n\\mu(x)=\\exp\\int\\frac{2x}{x^2-1}dx=x^2-1.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\bigl((x^2-1)y\\bigr)'=\\cos x,\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n(x^2-1)y=\\sin x+C.\n$$\n由 $y(0)=1$ 得 $-1=C$，所以\n$$\ny=\\frac{\\sin x-1}{x^2-1}=\\frac{1-\\sin x}{1-x^2}.\n$$", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\alpha=-3,\\ \\beta=2,\\ \\gamma=-1$，通解为 $y=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}+e^{2x}+(1+x)e^x$", "explanation": "将特解\n$$\ny_p=e^{2x}+(1+x)e^x\n$$\n代入原方程。计算得\n$$\ny_p'=2e^{2x}+(x+2)e^x,\\qquad y_p''=4e^{2x}+(x+3)e^x.\n$$\n代入后比较 $e^{2x}$、$xe^x$、$e^x$ 的系数，得方程组\n$$\n4+2\\alpha+\\beta=0,\\quad 1+\\alpha+\\beta=0,\\quad 3+2\\alpha+\\beta=\\gamma.\n$$\n解得\n$$\n\\alpha=-3,\\quad \\beta=2,\\quad \\gamma=-1.\n$$\n齐次方程为\n$$\ny''-3y'+2y=0,\n$$\n特征方程 $r^2-3r+2=0$，根为 $1,2$，故齐次通解\n$$\ny_h=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}.\n$$\n于是原方程通解为\n$$\ny=y_h+y_p=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}+e^{2x}+(1+x)e^x.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转体体积", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi^2}{2}-\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}$", "explanation": "区域满足\n$$\n(x-1)^2+y^2\\le1,\\qquad y\\ge x.\n$$\n交点由 $y=x$ 与圆联立得\n$$\n2x^2-2x=0\\Rightarrow x=0,1,\n$$\n对应 $y=0,1$。取 $y$ 为积分变量，则左、右边界分别为\n$$\nx=1-\\sqrt{1-y^2},\\qquad x=y\\quad(0\\le y\\le1).\n$$\n绕直线 $x=2$ 旋转，用圆环法：外半径\n$$\nR=2-(1-\\sqrt{1-y^2})=1+\\sqrt{1-y^2},\n$$\n内半径\n$$\nr=2-y.\n$$\n故体积\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^1\\bigl(R^2-r^2\\bigr)dy.\n$$\n展开并积分得\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^1\\left[2+2\\sqrt{1-y^2}-y^2-(4-4y+y^2)\\right]dy\n=\\pi\\left(-\\frac{4}{3}+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}-\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1993", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1993, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不等式证明", "函数单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1993_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1993_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "两边取自然对数，只需证明\n$$\na\\ln(a+x)<(a+x)\\ln a.\n$$\n移项后记\n$$\n\\phi(x)=(a+x)\\ln a-a\\ln(a+x).\n$$\n则\n$$\n\\phi'(x)=\\ln a-\\frac{a}{a+x}.\n$$\n因为 $a>e$，故 $\\ln a>1$；又对任意 $x>0$，有 $\\dfrac{a}{a+x}<1$，于是\n$$\n\\phi'(x)>0.\n$$\n所以 $\\phi(x)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上递增，而\n$$\n\\phi(0)=a\\ln a-a\\ln a=0.\n$$\n因此 $x>0$ 时 $\\phi(x)>0$，即\n$$\n(a+x)\\ln a-a\\ln(a+x)>0,\n$$\n从而\n$$\na\\ln(a+x)<(a+x)\\ln a.\n$$\n指数化便得\n$$\n(a+x)^a<a^{a+x}.\n$$", "methods": []}
